1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:09,570
Associated Press reports that new US tariffs of 50 percent on many Canadian products began after trade talks collapsed.

2
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:15,050
The measures affect about 20 billion dollars in goods, from food to furniture.

3
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:19,844
Canada says it will answer with matching tariffs from September 8.

4
00:00:19,844 --> 00:00:26,123
The dispute could raise prices for households and put more pressure on the USMCA trade system.

